      "id": 11396,
      "name": "MigrantP",
      "username": "MigrantP",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-10-14T00:28:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The digital version of Sentinels of the Multiverse is almost here! It's coming out on October 15th.</p><p>To celebrate, we're holding simultaneous launch parties in Cleveland and Halifax (we are a company that rises above mere international borders). Each party is being held on October 19th starting at 7 pm Eastern time (that's 8 pm Atlantic in Halifax). There are free drinks, free food, and prizes to be had! And of course you'll get to play the game if you haven't already.</p><p>We'll have a video link between the parties so everyone can chat with one another. If there's interest, maybe we can open it up to a generalized Google Hangout or Skype call? Let me know what you think.</p><p>To get free stuff you'll need to get a free ticket from the appropriate Eventbrite event. Please only take a ticket if you're really coming!</p><p><a href=\"http://www.eventbrite.com/e/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-the-video-game-launch-party-cleveland-tickets-13365868673\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Cleveland Eventbrite Page</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.eventbrite.com/e/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-the-video-game-launch-party-halifax-tickets-13442251135\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Halifax Eventbrite Page</a></p><p>Hope to see some of you on Sunday!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:41.858Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
