      "raw": "<p>The digital version of Sentinels of the Multiverse is almost here! It&#39;s coming out on October 15th.</p><p>To celebrate, we&#39;re holding simultaneous launch parties in Cleveland and Halifax (we are a company that rises above mere international borders). Each party is being held on October 19th starting at 7 pm Eastern time (that&#39;s 8 pm Atlantic in Halifax). There are free drinks, free food, and prizes to be had! And of course you&#39;ll get to play the game if you haven&#39;t already.</p><p>We&#39;ll have a video link between the parties so everyone can chat with one another. If there&#39;s interest, maybe we can open it up to a generalized Google Hangout or Skype call? Let me know what you think.</p><p>To get free stuff you&#39;ll need to get a free ticket from the appropriate Eventbrite event. Please only take a ticket if you&#39;re really coming!</p><p><a href=\"http://www.eventbrite.com/e/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-the-video-game-launch-party-cleveland-tickets-13365868673\">Cleveland Eventbrite Page</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.eventbrite.com/e/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-the-video-game-launch-party-halifax-tickets-13442251135\">Halifax Eventbrite Page</a></p><p>Hope to see some of you on Sunday!</p>",
